{"5106200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spot Kittens", "steam_appid": 5106200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a drone operator and set out on a relaxing hunt for hundreds of hidden kittens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful, 3D locations filled with funny details, strange places, and sneaky cats hiding in plain sight. Search every corner, spot the kittens, collect wool balls, and discover the secrets hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your observation skills in this charming and relaxing hidden-object game. Some cats will be easy to find… others will make you wonder how you could possibly have missed them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 600 kittens to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15  levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 wool balls to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 fun puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with no pressure or time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny sounds and playful interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great music full of nostalgia, relaxation, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by passionate indie game developers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy-to-learn experience for players of all ages</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a drone operator and set out on a relaxing hunt for hundreds of hidden kittens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful, 3D locations filled with funny details, strange places, and sneaky cats hiding in plain sight. Search every corner, spot the kittens, collect wool balls, and discover the secrets hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your observation skills in this charming and relaxing hidden-object game. Some cats will be easy to find… others will make you wonder how you could possibly have missed them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 600 kittens to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15  levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 wool balls to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 fun puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay with no pressure or time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny sounds and playful interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great music full of nostalgia, relaxation, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by passionate indie game developers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy-to-learn experience for players of all ages</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A casual hidden-cat game. Become a drone operator and spot all the kittens! Explore 15 levels. Find over 600 cats. Collect 88 balls of wool. Solve 10 puzzles. Relax, have fun, and enjoy the hunt. MEOW!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Romanian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106200/09799b2962cde6e29b37840141ce899634b26c27/header.jpg?t=1787237371", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106200/c413a5314db043298a2cf323fa3e667a1eabb7cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787237371", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106200/c413a5314db043298a2cf323fa3e